          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "روی دادن (ruy dâdan) — \"to occur, to happen (formal)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "این اتفاق ساعت ده شب روی داد. In ettefâq sâ'at-e dah-e shab ruy dâd. This happened at ten at night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal and common in the news. Literally \"to give a face\", to show itself. Present stem dah-: ruy midahad."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ruy dâdan joins ruy \"face\" and dâdan \"to give\", both inherited Persian; EtymDB takes dâdan back to the Indo-European root deh₃-, \"to give\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
