              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "صورت گرفتن (surat gereftan) — \"to take place, to be carried out\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جلسه دیروز صبح صورت گرفت. Jalase diruz sobh surat gereft. The meeting took place yesterday morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal, for planned actions. Literally \"to take form\". Present stem gir-: surat migirad."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "surat is borrowed from Arabic ṣūra, \"form, image\" (EtymDB). gereftan \"to take\" is inherited Persian, from the Old Persian root grab- \"to seize\"."
            }
          ]
        },
